  "goodToKnow": "Der Versicherer is an insurer or insurance company: Allianz and Munich Re, both based in Munich, are among the world's largest. Der/die Versicherte is the insured person. The verb versichern means to insure and also to assure: Ich versichere Ihnen, dass... Germans typically hold many policies; Haftpflichtversicherung (personal liability) is considered a must. Plural: die Versicherer."
